# Stock retail / cost total (единая живая сумма)

## Canonical

- Source: live `store_stock` + `products.selling_price` / `cost_price` via web-backend.
- Formula: `price × max(qty, 0)` (`StockRetailValueMath`).
- Missing store row → qty `0` (never stale `product.stockQuantity` for company totals).

## Surfaces

| UI | API |
|----|-----|
| Products «Сумма» | `GET /products/catalog-totals` |
| Dashboard «Остаток сейчас» / «Сумма прихода» | same totals overlaid in `mergeDashboardLiveStock` |
| Report «Остатки» | `GET /warehouse/reports/balances` |
| Report «Ниже минимума» | `GET /warehouse/reports/low-stock` |

Do **not** use `reporting_db` movement/snapshot facts for these current-stock money/qty KPIs.

## Still facts (OK)

Period movement reports: write-offs, turnover, receipts history, dead-stock (no-sale window), exports that still hit `/reports/stock/**`.
